# skills: War Breaker. Jian at level 30 (level index 29 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle
# (five enemies). Special lists six skills; Right, Right, Down is War Breaker (shot wr_list: 12, "Lower all
# monsters' attack"). A casts with no picker: Jian raises his fist and the ATK DOWN banner shows on each
# enemy in turn (wr_cast); MP 50 -> 38 once; the ATK stage (+0x40) of battlers 4, 5, 6, 9, and 10 goes to -1
# (0xFFFF; a later 8 is the back-row enemy moving down). Next round the same pick is refused with "No
# effect!" (wr_refused): every living enemy is lowered already, and no MP is taken. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 29
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
peek u32 0x020B8550 work
watch u32 0x0228e878 jian_mp
watch u16 0x0228ea50 atk_stage4
watch u16 0x0228eabc atk_stage5
watch u16 0x0228eb28 atk_stage6
watch u16 0x0228ec00 atk_stage8
watch u16 0x0228ec6c atk_stage9
watch u16 0x0228ecd8 atk_stage10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
shot wr_list
press A 8
wait 50
wait 30
shot wr_cast
wait 40
shot wr_cast2
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 600
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
shot wr_refused
wait 100
shot wr_after
